  "description": "ALL-TERRAIN ALL-SEASONS AWD STEP-THROUGH!\nThe step-thru dual motor Mammoth 750 is quickly becoming the go-to bike for hunters and anglers, offering unmatched accessibility and robust performance in the great outdoors. Its powerful dual motors and easy-access design make it ideal for navigating rugged terrains while carrying gear, making it a top choice for the modern outdoorsman.\nSUPER MAMMOTH 750 AWD ST - DUAL MOTOR MONSTER!\nThis Vamoose Super Mammoth AWD e-bike comes with two 52V 750W motors (front and rear) providing exceptional power and torque for climbing hills or crushing fresh powder! An impressive machine, the Super Mammoth comes standard with a truly gigantic 52V 20Ah battery producing an incredible 1040 Watt-hours of performance - a range of +84 km! Even better, you can add an additional 52V 15Ah battery to take you even further (1850 watt hours and 150 km)!\nThis cycle comes standard with the following adders:\n\n• Dual 52V 750W motors (ability to down-sample to 500W)\n\n• 52V 20Ah Samsung Battery with additional battery optional\n\n• A 6061 aircraft aluminum frame with alloy front forks\n\n• 26\" x 4.8” Fat Tires\n\n• Front and rear fenders\n\nKD986 w Bluetooth, down-sampling, USB\n\n21700 50 E CELLS 52V 20Ah Samsung\n\nBOXER Inverted Air with 150mm travel\n\nTektro HD-E730 Dorado 4 PISTON Hydraulic 203mm rotors front and rear\n\n26\" x 4.8\" MAXXIS MINION FBR FBF\n\nRear, with front mount option\n\n4-6 hrs.\n\n166 x 34 x 86.5\n\n66 X 13 X 34\n\n41 kg NW / 51 kg GW\n\n90 lbs NW / 112 lbs GW\n\n330 lbs.",
